      "title": "Energy secretary says US might not reach nuclear agreement with Iran",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-iran-nuclear-agreement-chris-wright",
      "description": "<p>Chris Wright tells ABC there ‘may not’ be an agreement that would prevent Iran from having nuclear weapons</p><p>US energy secretary Chris Wright said on Sunday morning that the US may not be able to reach a nuclear agreement with Iran that would prevent the country from having nuclear weapons.</p><p>Asked on ABC on Sunday morning about any sign of such a deal, as negotiations appear stalled and the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/us-israel-war-on-iran\">US-Israel war on Iran</a> continues, Wright said: “There may not be a nuclear agreement.”</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/06/us-iran-nuclear-agreement-chris-wright\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
